  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0：Update to LHZ.WebSocket 1.2.0; keep the context status Upgraded after a connection closes instead of reporting it as Rejected, and dispose the upgraded stream; make Dispose idempotent and complete the request with TrySetResult so concurrent close/timeout no longer throws; cancel the handshake timeout watcher once the handshake is claimed, and make status transitions atomic; validate the Connection header and the Sec-WebSocket-Key length; detect the Upgrade token in multi-valued headers; reject a second upgrade attempt on the same context; share the client registry across branched pipelines; mark the synchronous HttpUpgrade obsolete in favour of HttpUpgradeAsync",
